---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Peggy — Learning Experience & Products"
  description="I design learning experiences and build products for the people who run learning — at TalentLabs, at Dao Dao, and in a live solo build."
>
  <!-- ==== 1. HERO ====================================================== -->
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Learning experience · Product</p>
    <h1>Peggy</h1>
    <div class="hero__lines">
      <p>I design learning experiences, and I build products for the people who make learning happen.</p>
      <p>The thread through all of it — helping people start, and helping them finish.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 2. WHAT I'M WORKING ON ==================================== -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">What I'm working on</p>
      <h2>The products I'm building and shaping</h2>
      <p>Three angles on the same thing — strategy, day-to-day delivery, and shipping solo — around making learning that people actually finish.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="work-grid">
      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Learning Product Manager · 2022 – present</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">TalentLabs</h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          Enterprise B2B learning programmes reaching 500+ working professionals a year across technical, business, and HR audiences — increasingly focused on AI capability building. I lead product strategy, UX, and research, shaped by what actually keeps learners showing up.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">B2B enterprise</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">AI capability</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">Learning design</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Product Strategy Advisor · 2023 – present</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://daodao.so" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dao Dao</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          Early-stage edtech — a peer-first self-directed learning platform. Working with the founding team on product direction, B2B2C pivot strategy, PRDs, and competitor research, from concept to shipped iterations.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Product strategy</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Edtech</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">MVP</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="work-card__link">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://daodao.so" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">daodao.so →</a>
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Solo build · shipped 2025</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://www.in-betweens.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">in-betweens.cc</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          A live Lenormand web app — concept, design, and build, alone, with Claude as my primary collaborator. Proof that thinking clearly and shipping cleanly can be the same person's job.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Solo build</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">AI-assisted</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">Web app</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="work-card__link">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://www.in-betweens.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">in-betweens.cc →</a>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 3. HOW AI CHANGED THE WORK ================================ -->
  <section class="wrap section wrap--prose">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">How I work</p>
      <h2>Where AI has quietly changed the work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Claude and ChatGPT are in my daily flow now — turning user interviews into readable insight, turning fuzzy ideas into specs teams can react to, turning competitor scans into a single page, and turning notions into clickable prototypes.</p>
      <p>I don't lean on the phrase "AI-native", but the substance of it is real — I can now finish alone what used to take a small team. <a class="uwp-link" href="https://www.in-betweens.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">in-betweens.cc</a> is the clearest example.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 4. WHAT I CARE ABOUT ================================= -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">What I care about</p>
      <h2>The ideas I keep coming back to</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="problems">
      <li>
        <h3>Products people can finish</h3>
        <p>Completion is a design problem, not a willpower problem. I care about the small frictions that quietly decide whether someone takes the next step or drifts away — most visible in learning products, true of anything that needs people to come back.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Across languages and cultures</h3>
        <p>I've studied and worked across Taiwan and Australia, and I've run cohorts and B2B accounts in both English and Mandarin. Good product experience has to translate, not just be translated.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 5. SOFT CTA =============================================== -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>If you're shaping learning or products, let's talk.</h2>
      <p>Teams building products, early-stage startups needing product strategy, or anyone thinking about AI-shaped workflows — I read every note.</p>
      <a class="uwp-button uwp-button--accent uwp-button--lg" href="mailto:peichun1213@gmail.com">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .work-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-6);
  }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .work-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-3);
    padding: var(--uwp-space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--uwp-color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--uwp-radius-lg, 12px);
    background: var(--uwp-color-surface, transparent);
  }
  .work-card__role {
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-sm);
    color: var(--uwp-color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__title {
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-xl);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__desc {
    color: var(--uwp-color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-2);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--uwp-space-1) 0 0;
  }
  .work-card__link {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--uwp-space-2);
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-sm);
  }
</style>
